commit cbf59b836645b6ac69ad8c47a560598bc4942ecc
Author: DJ Delorie <dj@redhat.com>
Date:   Mon Sep 28 14:27:16 2026 +0200

    CVE-2026-89092: nscd: replace alloca with malloc in aicache, hstcache
    
    This changes the alloca fallback to a malloc fallback
    in the addrinfo and host cache code.
    
    This fixes bug 34624.
    
    Co-authored-by: Florian Weimer <fweimer@redhat.com>
    Reviewed-by: Adhemerval Zanella <adhemerval.zanella@linaro.org>

Conflicts:
	nscd/hstcache.c
	  Regenerated for context changes

diff -rup a/nscd/aicache.c b/nscd/aicache.c
